&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Keep the inventory up to date in our asset management tool and ensure the accuracy of serial numbers, assignments and statuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Follow the full equipment lifecycle, including assignment, return, loan, vendor repair, refurbishment and recycling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Run periodic physical inventories and consistency checks between physical stock and the asset management tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor stock levels, flag replenishment thresholds and contribute to supplier orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Prepare devices, including mobile device management enrolment, standard configuration and accessory kits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Propose improvements to stock processes, documentation, automation and key performance indicators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;On-site support — approximately 30%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
