&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Paris, France (Hybrid)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Are&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team in &lt;strong&gt;France &lt;/strong&gt;consists of &lt;strong&gt;45 &lt;/strong&gt;people (including 14 Technical Account Managers based either in France or Poland) and is an integral part of our company’s global presence. We combine local expertise with our broader company vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Technical Account Management Team Leader&lt;/strong&gt; you will lead and coordinate a team responsible for technical support, oversee the launch and optimisation of RTB advertising campaigns and ensure effective collaboration with clients and internal stakeholders. You will report directly to the Country Manager based in France and the Head of Global Technical Support Solutions based in Headquarters, Warsaw.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support, coordinate and supervise the work of the team members responsible for the technical support of the company&#39;s business teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launching and optimising advertising campaigns with Real-Time Bidding technology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with local sales managers and account managers, as well as technical teams and departments across the company;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tools and procedures in order to improve the work of both your own and other technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;7 years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional experience, including &lt;strong&gt;5 years in digital marketing &lt;/strong&gt;(preferably within retargeting) in technical roles and minimum &lt;strong&gt;2 years in a leadership role &lt;/strong&gt;managing senior team members;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of online campaign management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Firebug tools, Chrome DevTools and debugging tracking scripts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of HTML / JavaScript, Google Analytics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English language&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French is mandatory for external candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unique opportunity to join a creative, fast-growing company in online advertising;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great opportunity for professional growth by joining the global leader in innovation, to building partnerships with top brands in France;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to work in a truly international environment with the best people;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Becoming part of an award-winning organisation, with outstanding growth numbers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on a great product based on the newest AI Technology (Deep Learning);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working and learning in one of the fastest-growing tech companies in Europe;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rewarding career in a friendly and inspiring atmosphere with no corporate habits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to contribute to ambitious projects in the growing, international organisation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A training program to develop your professional skills further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
