&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
